```
No email logic here; it simply delegates to the repository.

## 4. OwnerRepository (Spring Data JPA)

Base interface: `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/repository/OwnerRepository.java` — methods: `findByLastName(String)` (46), `findByLastName(String, Pageable)` (48), `findById(int)` (57), `save(Owner)` (66), `findAll()` (74), `findAll(Pageable)` (76), `delete(Owner)` (84). No email query.

