- `AuditLogCapture.java` — test support for audit-log assertions.

The class-level Javadoc in `AcceptanceTest` states the target rule: "email-unique: Reject creating an owner whose lower-cased email is already used by any other owner." This test will currently fail because `addOwner` has no email check.

